    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally a Florist is a cozy, slice-of-life florist simulator!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753270/extras/5846c980dda12fa9e1d61836729b8c31.avif?t=1749800081\" width=634 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Mo, a recently retired professional who has always wanted to be a florist. Pulled now to support his town by making bouquets for various occasions, get a sneak peek into people's lives as you celebrate all life has to offer.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore new biomes, collect flowers, and arrange bouquets to fit your customer's needs. The town is counting on you to become the florist you've always dreamed.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish quests, unlock recipes, and befriend animals in this point-and-click, wholesome adventure.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally a Florist is a cozy, slice-of-life florist simulator!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753270/extras/5846c980dda12fa9e1d61836729b8c31.avif?t=1749800081\" width=634 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Mo, a recently retired professional who has always wanted to be a florist. Pulled now to support his town by making bouquets for various occasions, get a sneak peek into people's lives as you celebrate all life has to offer.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore new biomes, collect flowers, and arrange bouquets to fit your customer's needs. The town is counting on you to become the florist you've always dreamed.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish quests, unlock recipes, and befriend animals in this point-and-click, wholesome adventure.</p>",
    "short_description": "Finally a Florist is a cozy, slice-of-life game where you gather flowers to arrange beautiful bouquets. Explore peaceful landscapes, befriend animals, and fill heartfelt requests from the local villagers as you finally become a florist.",
